ms="sechead-rule" class="h-[3px] bg-[var(--p500)] shadow-[0_2px_0_var(--pEdge)] mt-[12px]"></div></div><div class="ms-list-section-body ms-hub-body"><p class="ms-list-answer-body">Every item in Minecraft Java and Bedrock Edition, grouped the way you would actually go looking for one: tools, weapons, armour, food, potions, resources and the rest.</p><p class="ms-hub-counts">There are 752 items in Bedrock 1.26.60, split across 10 groups:<!-- --> <a href="/items/tools" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Tools</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->86<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/weapons" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Weapons</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->18<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/ammunition" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Ammunition</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->43<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/equipments" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Equipments</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->44<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/food" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Food</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->40<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/seeds" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Seeds</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->17<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/potions" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Potions</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->148<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/enchantments" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Enchantments</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->42<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/resources" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Resources</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->74<!-- -->)<!-- -->, <a href="/items/misc" class="ms-namelink ms-press">Misc</a> <!-- -->(<!-- -->240<!-- -->)<!-- -->.</p><div class="ms-list-faq"><div class="ms-list-faq-item"><h3 class="ms-list-faq-q">How many items are in Minecraft?</h3><p class="ms-list-faq-a">752, counted across all 10 groups in Bedrock 1.26.60. The biggest group is Misc with 240; the smallest is Seeds with 17. Blocks you can place are counted separately, under Blocks, which is why this number is smaller than a raw count of everything in the game.</p></div><div class="ms-list-faq-item"><h3 class="ms-list-faq-q">What is the difference between an item and a block in Minecraft?</h3><p class="ms-list-faq-a">A block takes up a space in the world; an item only ever lives in your inventory or your hand. The line is not clean in either direction — nearly every block also exists as an item while you are carrying it — so this catalogue follows the in-game grouping rather than trying to settle the argument: anything you place is listed under Blocks, and everything else is here.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="contents DIsf9G_variable font-nunito font-semibold"></div></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/&--><!--/&--></section><!--/&--><!--$?--><template id="B:3"></template><footer class="border-t-[3px] border-[var(--face)] bg-[var(--g600)] shadow-[inset_0_3px_0_var(--hi)]" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1160px] grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr))] items-start gap-[26px] px-5 pb-[26px] pt-[30px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3"><div class="h-[24px] w-[82px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[40px] w-full max-w-[260px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[30px] w-[34px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[70px] w-full max-w-[308px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[9px]"><div class="h-[11px] w-[64px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[15px] w-[92px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[15px] w-[80px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[9px]"><div class="h-[11px] w-[64px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[15px] w-[92px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[15px] w-[80px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[9px]"><div class="h-[11px] w-[64px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[15px] w-[92px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div><div class="h-[15px] w-[80px] animate-pulse bg-[var(--g500)]"></div></div></div><div